# MQ02 "Die Pilgerreise": Vanmiria sends the player to Narathzul Arantheal's shrine (cell AranthealSchrein, south of the
# Sanktum). Reading the inscription (MQ02SchreinScn on MQ03Inschrift) shows a message box, then moves the player into the
# shadow world (MQ02SchattenweltMarker, MQ02Schicksalshallen); the trigger script MQ02TriggerSaranthaSCN speaks and sets
# MQ02 6, and Sarantha02's greeting (INFO 001EE24D) sets MQ02 10. Stages are TES4 numbers.
# Not drafted: the way back to Vanmiria (MQ02 14/15 and MQ03 5) because nothing in the export shows how the player leaves
# the shadow world.

# The shrine is a long walk from the Sanktum; moveto the inscription (placed ref 001A3DC3) stands in for it.
# The inscription reacts only while MQ02 is exactly at stage 5; its box is a one-button Debug.MessageBox.
case pilgrimage_inscription
expect GetStage MQ02 == 5
console player.moveto 001A3DC3
activate 001A3DC3
wait 30
button 0
until 900 GetStageDone MQ02 6
end

# The trigger zone's voice, then Sarantha02 in the shadow world; her greeting sets MQ02 10 and lets teleporting work again.
case pilgrimage_shadow_world
hear 900 Sarantha02 Willkommen, Schattengeborener
talk Sarantha02
hear 300 Sarantha02 Na, ein wenig
bye
expect GetStageDone MQ02 10
end
